Used in mlx-stream: the MTPLX-STREAMING Python runtime for DeepSeek-V4.1 is
the reference this plugin was ported from and its parity oracle: the packed
expert record and manifest formats (`mtplx-expert-manifest-v*`,
`mtplx-engram-manifest-v*`), the streamed-bank layout read by
src/expert_bank.zig, and the routed-expert EXL3 Metal kernels pinned under
src/kernels/exl3/ (src/exl3_kernels.zig).

Modifications by mlx-stream: the runtime was reimplemented in Zig against
mlx-c behind mlx-serve's plugin SDK; the kernel texts are embedded at compile
time and pinned by the manifest's sha256; the read pool (csrc/) and the event
gates were written for this plugin.

