The EXL3 format this plugin reads (the mul1 codebook, the trellis packing, the
tensor-core permutation and the Hadamard suh / svh transforms) follows
exllamav3 v1.4.2 (codebook.cuh, exl3_dq.cuh, pack.cu, hadamard.cu,
quantize.py); src/exl3_quant.zig and src/exl3_kernels.zig cite the lines they
reproduce.

